---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Linh Nguyen">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto pt-8">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-8 text-gray-900 dark:text-white">
      Personal Catalog of Memorable Strava Activities
    </h1>
    <p class="text-lg mb-8 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">Memes:</p>
    <ul class="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 mb-12 pl-6">
      <li>
        <a href="https://strava.app.link/dkyVKts6BTb">Airport Walk</a> - walked to
        from SF to SFO for a flight
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="https://strava.app.link/MBQouYb6BTb">Canoe to Canada</a> - spontaneous
        canoe from Minnesota to Canada
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="https://strava.app.link/fkAXu8n6BTb">Swim to Mexico</a> - spontaneous
        swim from Texas to Mexico
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="https://strava.app.link/Nik0iL1kHTb">Track century</a> - 100 miles
        of biking around a track
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="https://strava.app.link/hBIufsx6BTb"
          >(2nd) Minnesota State Fair</a
        > - trialed <a
          href="https://www.reddit.com/r/gainit/comments/kug8ma/the_gallon_of_milk_a_day_gomad_doing_it_right/"
          >GOMAD</a
        > lite by eating/drinking nothing but milk for a day from the $2 all-you-can-drink
        milk stand
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="https://strava.app.link/dUyAyNW6BTb">Patagonia "backpacking"</a
        > - everything I needed for 4 days in a 10 L backpack
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="https://strava.app.link/1GhLNR06BTb"
          >Self-transcendence 1 mile</a
        > - visited the <a href="https://3100.srichinmoyraces.org/"
          >world's longest footrace</a
        >
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="https://strava.app.link/ZPSNof46BTb">Bike to Indiana</a> - touched
        the tip
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="https://strava.app.link/4gLXTL76BTb">Daywheels</a> - relay-style
        ride to every bike share station in SF
      </li>
    </ul>
    <p class="text-lg mb-8 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
      Spicing up easy run days with Strava art:
    </p>
    <ul class="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 mb-12 pl-6">
      <li>
        <a href="https://strava.app.link/TSXnmUi7BTb">Snail</a> - designed by me
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="https://strava.app.link/X9OL3ol7BTb">Space-filling curve</a> - designed
        by Star
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="https://strava.app.link/bVsyq2m7BTb">Bernalosaurus</a> - designed
        by Tally
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="https://strava.app.link/TZI3qMq7BTb">🎶</a> - designed by Courtney
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="https://strava.app.link/7z9yWss7BTb">Pi</a> - designed by Joanne
      </li>
    </ul>
    <p class="text-lg mb-8 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
      Other memorable excursions (a super incomplete list):
    </p>
    <ul class="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 pl-6 mb-12">
      <li>
        <a href="https://strava.app.link/TsTq3lE7BTb">Tour de Bay</a> - bike ride
        around the SF Bay, first century
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="https://strava.app.link/gJTqiQG7BTb">Lost Coast</a> - I like long
        walks on the beach
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="https://strava.app.link/BvNriMJ7BTb">Roys Peak</a> - a race against
        the sun
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="https://strava.app.link/eHOPKzS8BTb">Cave Stream</a> - a spontaneous
        half hike/half swim in New Zealand
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="https://strava.app.link/hQUOx7U8BTb">Sulphur Creek</a> - yet another
        half hike/half swim in a Utah slot canyoneering route
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="https://strava.app.link/6IcvziX8BTb">Isle Royale</a> - hiked most
        of this with a ping pong ball-sized blister on my foot from a poison ivy
        sitch
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="https://strava.app.link/XRictyZ8BTb">Wind River Range</a> - hiked
        most of this on a 1.5x swollen leg from yet another poison ivy sitch
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="https://strava.app.link/RdkP5g18BTb">Whitney day hike</a> - sleep-deprived
        hike with the COVID hiking pod
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="https://strava.app.link/S3gGwR28BTb">Petra</a> - navigated my most
        logistically complex border crossing to date (traveling with an Israeli into
        Jordan during COVID) for this hike
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="https://strava.app.link/XPeWfs48BTb">Enchantments</a> - everybody
        loves alpine lakes
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="https://strava.app.link/RMpYGo68BTb">Four Lakes</a> - California's
        Enchantments, hit the spot right after quitting a job
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="https://strava.app.link/Kv7e2Z88BTb"
          >Boundary Waters canoe camping</a
        > - playing drunken pirates
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="https://strava.app.link/nXk3A8c9BTb">Shimanami</a>
        <a href="https://strava.app.link/eYExfqe9BTb">Kaido</a> - delightful DIY
        bike tour of Japanese islands near Hiroshima
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="https://strava.app.link/MXvPGoh9BTb">RAGBRAI</a> - first real bike
        ride, spontaneously flew to Iowa to join 1 day of RAGBRAI 2022
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="https://strava.app.link/LW682vj9BTb">Christmas at Brighton</a> -
        skiing in a sea of Santas
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</Layout>
